{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Disposition note 2026-09-07: RCA showed this is not a product defect. The apparent stale-material review was my diagnostic error: audit plan_reviews is newest-first, but I read plan_reviews[-1] (oldest). Newer sidecars show current material and llm_ran=True. Follow-up idea, not filed as new work: make audit JSON/docs make newest-first ordering harder to misuse, e.g. explicit latest_plan_review or clearer labeling."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788784414560819001,"uuid":"a5f36d5c-d603-4c3d-adc2-9166b9c7199a"}